 "note": [
  "Taylor quotes scripture constantly but almost never cites it, so the references were identified by the chapter translators (cross-checked against the es/am editions' notes). Every quotation is in the Swahili Union Version (SUV) tradition the shipped sw corpus quotes — not swhonen, a different revised edition. Where a shipped *.sw.json carries the SUV words they were pasted verbatim and the row is `mined` with that file; otherwise the row is `self_rendered` in the SUV register and needs a native check.",
  "Several `self_rendered` rows (e.g. Philippians 4:19, Genesis 42:36, Psalm 18:30, Matthew 9:38) are Taylor's unmarked echoes woven into his own sentences rather than set quotations.",
  "Clock times are CONVERTED to Swahili reckoning (ten at night → saa nne usiku; nine in the morning → saa tatu asubuhi; 4 to 6 p.m. → saa 10 hadi saa 12), matching a-retrospect-teens.sw and a-retrospect-children.sw. Durations are untouched.",
  "Book title Kutazama Nyuma heads the family Kutazama Nyuma (Kwa Watoto) / (Kwa Vijana)."
 ],
